+```
+App Name: NFT Flip Alert
+
+Description:
+NFT Flip Alert is a Mini App that tracks NFT collections and identifies potential opportunities for profitable flips. Monitor price changes, volume spikes, and floor price trends in real time. Receive instant notifications when high-potential NFTs appear for quick buying and selling.
+
+Key Features:
+ • Real-time tracking of NFT floor prices and volume
+ • Alerts for profitable flipping opportunities
+ • Analysis of trending collections and high-demand NFTs
+ • Historical price and sales charts
+ • Dashboard to monitor multiple NFT collections simultaneously
+
+Use Case:
+Ideal for NFT traders and collectors looking to buy low and sell high, capitalizing on market trends and high-demand assets.
+```
+
